The '''World Tourism rankings''' are compiled by the [[United Nations]]'s [[World Tourism Organization]] as part of their ''World Tourism Barometer'' publication, which is released up to six times per year. It ranks destinations by the number of international visitor arrivals, by the [[revenue]] generated by inbound [[tourism]], and by the [[cost|expenditure]] of outbound travelers.

